### Interval case - create rule 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/logger
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: datalink_session_token=dd9e6e7c-7dcc-465e-829f-e2bfce2b4978

{
  "name": "zber dat",
  "machineId": "M",
  "triggerType": "TIME",
  "interval": 5000,
  "tags": ["Step", "Cycle time", "Product count"]
}

### Edge case - create rule
POST http://localhost:3000/api/logger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "z",
  "machineId": "MF1",
  "triggerType": "EDGE",
  "triggerTag": "Product count",
  "triggerValue": 100,
  "triggerOperator": ">",
  "tags": ["Step", "Cycle time", "Product count"]
}

